    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surge Point</strong> is a fast-paced, single-player FPS roguelike with deep weapon customization and high-mobility combat. Inspired by classics like <i>DOOM</i> and <i>Quake</i>, it throws you into a simulated arena filled with deadly robotic enemies. Build your own weapon, master the movement system, and survive endless waves \u2014 or fight through hand-crafted levels in Mission Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Weapons, Built Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no pre-made guns \u2014 just you and your arsenal of parts. Find components during your run and snap them together to create the ultimate weapon:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barrels, bodies, mags, stocks, sights, and grips that directly impact fire rate, accuracy, damage, reload time, bullet velocity, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special ammo types like explosive rounds, bouncing shots, and tracer fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time part swapping lets you adapt your weapon to every new threat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.poster.avif?t=1747202802\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.webm?t=1747202802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.mp4?t=1747202802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, Fluid Movement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat isn\u2019t just about firepower \u2014 it\u2019s about speed, agility, and style. Surge Point\u2019s movement system rewards creative play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic FPS controls (run, jump, strafe) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun recoil propels you backward \u2014 master it to dodge, reposition, or launch yourself through the air</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deployable holo cubes create temporary platforms for aerial maneuvers and tactical positioning</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/4977506637abc17ba48ff38bb80f1389.poster.avif?t=1747202802\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/4977506637abc17ba48ff38bb80f1389.webm?t=1747202802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/4977506637abc17ba48ff38bb80f1389.mp4?t=1747202802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: Survive wave after wave of randomized arenas and escalating threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission Mode</strong>: Take on hand-crafted levels with unique objectives, layouts, and boss encounters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modular weapon system with real-time customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed combat with advanced movement mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of enemy types, map tiles, and visual themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses, mini-bosses, and escalating enemy waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep stat-driven weapon crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental interactions and destructibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full keybinding and controller remapping support</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surge Point</strong> is a fast-paced, single-player FPS roguelike with deep weapon customization and high-mobility combat. Inspired by classics like <i>DOOM</i> and <i>Quake</i>, it throws you into a simulated arena filled with deadly robotic enemies. Build your own weapon, master the movement system, and survive endless waves \u2014 or fight through hand-crafted levels in Mission Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Weapons, Built Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no pre-made guns \u2014 just you and your arsenal of parts. Find components during your run and snap them together to create the ultimate weapon:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barrels, bodies, mags, stocks, sights, and grips that directly impact fire rate, accuracy, damage, reload time, bullet velocity, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special ammo types like explosive rounds, bouncing shots, and tracer fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time part swapping lets you adapt your weapon to every new threat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.poster.avif?t=1747202802\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.webm?t=1747202802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.mp4?t=1747202802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, Fluid Movement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat isn\u2019t just about firepower \u2014 it\u2019s about speed, agility, and style. Surge Point\u2019s movement system rewards creative play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic FPS controls (run, jump, strafe) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun recoil propels you backward \u2014 master it to dodge, reposition, or launch yourself through the air</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deployable holo cubes create temporary platforms for aerial maneuvers and tactical positioning</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/4977506637abc17ba48ff38bb80f1389.poster.avif?t=1747202802\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/4977506637abc17ba48ff38bb80f1389.webm?t=1747202802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/4977506637abc17ba48ff38bb80f1389.mp4?t=1747202802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: Survive wave after wave of randomized arenas and escalating threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission Mode</strong>: Take on hand-crafted levels with unique objectives, layouts, and boss encounters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modular weapon system with real-time customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed combat with advanced movement mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of enemy types, map tiles, and visual themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses, mini-bosses, and escalating enemy waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep stat-driven weapon crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental interactions and destructibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full keybinding and controller remapping support</p></li></ul>",
